sequenceDiagram
    participant Session
    participant Statement
    participant Results
    participant Publisher
    participant APIServer
    Session->>Statement: Try candidate placement
    Session->>Results: Record evaluation and gang failure
    Session->>Statement: Discard trial
    Statement-->>Session: Restore scheduling resources
    Session->>Results: Finalize after all actions
    Results-->>Publisher: Pod outcome and group summary
    Publisher->>APIServer: Initial condition and Event publication
    APIServer-->>Publisher: API results
    Publisher->>Publisher: Later snapshot reflects informer updates
    loop Next scheduling attempt
        Session->>Statement: Try and discard another candidate
        Session->>Results: Finalize equivalent facts
        Results-->>Publisher: Same final diagnostics
        Publisher->>Publisher: Skip unchanged Pod writes and Events
        Publisher->>Publisher: Apply PodGroup Event policy
    end
